<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<style>
    body {
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    }
    /* Specific styling for the certification section header accents */
    .cert-accent {
        width: 40px;
        height: 12px;
        background-color: #f6ad55; /* Orange-400 */
        display: inline-block;
    }
</style>

<body class="bg-gray-50">
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main>
        <section class="py-16 px-6 bg-white">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
                <div class="md:w-2/3 space-y-10">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                            <span class="w-8 h-2 bg-red-600"></span>
                            <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-gray-900">About Us</h2>
                            <span class="w-8 h-2 bg-red-600"></span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
                            Solanki Pipes was established in 2005. For over 15 years, Solanki Pipes has been a trusted name in the pipe industry with its distribution network all over India. We are a dynamic, quality-driven company with a firm eye on the future. The strength of our company lies in our quality products and satisfied customers. We are a leading manufacturer of HDPE Pipes, HDPE Gas Pipes, PVC Pipes, Sprinkler Pipes, PPR Pipes, HDPE Fittings, and Synthetic Rubber Adhesive. Our factories are situated at Hisar, Mandi Adampur in Fatehabad District, Haryana.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                            <span class="w-8 h-2 bg-red-600"></span>
                            <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-gray-900">Solanki Pipes to Excellence</h2>
                            <span class="w-8 h-2 bg-red-600"></span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
                            We obtained certification from ISO-9001:2015 and follow all procedures and processes needed to fulfill the quality management system. We are committed to total customer satisfaction which shall be achieved by providing cost-effective quality products with timely delivery.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="md:w-1/3">
                    <img src="/image/IMG_0538.jpg.jpeg" alt="Industrial Pipe Stacks" class="w-full drop-shadow-2xl">
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        
        <section class="py-16 px-6 bg-white">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-12">
                    <div class="flex items-center">
                        <span class="cert-accent"></span>
                        <span class="w-1 h-3 bg-red-700 ml-1"></span>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-red-700 uppercase tracking-widest">Certifications</h2>
                    <div class="flex items-center">
                        <span class="w-1 h-3 bg-red-700 mr-1"></span>
                        <span class="cert-accent"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-8">
                    <div class="bg-white p-1 shadow-md border border-gray-200">
                        <img src="https://placehold.co/400x600/ffffff/000000?text=ISO+9001:2015" alt="ISO Certification" class="w-full h-auto">
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white p-1 shadow-md border border-gray-200">
                        <img src="https://placehold.co/400x600/ffffff/000000?text=Trade+Mark+Registry" alt="Trademark" class="w-full h-auto">
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white p-1 shadow-md border border-gray-200">
                        <img src="https://placehold.co/400x600/ffffff/000000?text=BIS+Certificate+ENG" alt="BIS English" class="w-full h-auto">
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white p-1 shadow-md border border-gray-200">
                        <img src="https://placehold.co/400x600/ffffff/000000?text=BIS+Certificate+HIN" alt="BIS Hindi" class="w-full h-auto">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-red-700 py-4 px-4 text-center">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                        <span class="w-1 h-8 bg-orange-400"></span>
                        <p class="text-white text-xl md:text-3xl font-bold">
                            "Preferred by Farmers. Trusted Across North India"
                        </p>
                        <span class="w-1 h-8 bg-orange-400"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>